{"id":"npc:%E4%BD%A9%E7%89%B9%E6%B4%9B%E5%A8%83","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"乌萨斯人，雪怪小队成员之一。","spoiler":true,"source":"主线剧情6-10 解开铃铛、6-12 冰原之雪、R8-8 人心，向背无常等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_npc_037_2.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/f/f6/Avg_avg_npc_037_2.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_037_2.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"obt/main/level_main_06-09_end","lineCount":3,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":242,"line":243,"speaker":"佩特洛娃","text":"杨格，过来。"},{"commandIndex":246,"line":247,"speaker":"佩特洛娃","text":"过来！"},{"commandIndex":250,"line":251,"speaker":"佩特洛娃","text":"你必须信。大姊她没剩多少时间了。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_06-11_beg","lineCount":18,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":135,"line":136,"speaker":"佩特洛娃","text":"她说别哭。"},{"commandIndex":348,"line":349,"speaker":"佩特洛娃","text":"幻影弩手们，可别让我们失望啊。一定要把大姊送回老爷子身边。"},{"commandIndex":360,"line":361,"speaker":"佩特洛娃","text":"大熊！我们上了！"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_08-08_beg","lineCount":16,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":32,"line":33,"speaker":"佩特洛娃","text":"兄弟姐妹们，没事吧？！"},{"commandIndex":38,"line":39,"speaker":"佩特洛娃","text":"有塔露拉你在身边，我们的感觉也是一样的。你和我们配合得很好，难怪大姊肯放心让你带我们作战。"},{"commandIndex":125,"line":126,"speaker":"佩特洛娃","text":"（你是说……）"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_08-08_end","lineCount":1,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":92,"line":93,"speaker":"佩特洛娃","text":"……还在山坳口那。她说要守住据点直到我们成功夺下城市。"}]}]}